OL,3,GNEWSAHandshakes, heckles and a row over
OL,4,Asecurity patrols near asylum base
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a town centre shopping street, two
OL,7,Fmen wearing white shirts and bright red
OL,8,Ftabards are walking side by side.
OL,10,FThey are security guards introduced in
OL,11,FBraintree, Colchester and Chelmsford,
OL,12,Fthree locations frequently visited by
OL,13,Fasylum seekers, bussed in each day from
OL,14,FMDP Wethersfield, a former RAF airfield
OL,15,Fin the Essex countryside.
OL,17,FThe guards have been hired by the
OL,18,FReform UK-led county council in a new
OL,19,Fthree-month initiative aimed at
OL,20,Fdeterring anti-social behaviour (ASB)
OL,21,Fin response to what it says are
OL,22,Fresidents' concerns.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
